   "since": "2026-09-21",
   "unit": null,
   "value": "The Census Monitoring Board was established under the Act of Nov. 26, 1997 (111 Stat. 2483)\r\n\r\nThe Board consisted of 8 members, whose duties were to monitor all aspects of the preparation and implementation of the 2000 decennial census (including dress rehearsals and other simulations of a census in preparation therefore). \r\n\r\nThe Board was terminated as provided in the establishing act as of September 30, 2001.",
